#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:4
msgid "v4.8.8"
msgstr "v4.8.8"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.8.8 adds explicit bootloader-entry controls for connecting and updating "
"OpenMV Cams, a per-board safe default for forcing bootloader entry from the "
"\"Install the Latest Development Release\" dialog, and a handful of "
"connection and installer fixes. This release remains based on Qt Creator "
"14.0.2, with no Qt Creator base change and no breaking changes for user "
"projects."
msgstr ""
"v4.8.8 dodaje eksplicitne kontrole za ulazak u bootloader pri povezivanju i "
"ažuriranju OpenMV Cam kamera, sigurnu zadanu postavku po pločici za prisilni"
" ulazak u bootloader iz dijaloga \"Install the Latest Development Release\" "
"te nekoliko ispravaka povezivanja i instalacijskog programa. Ovo izdanje i "
"dalje se temelji na Qt Creatoru 14.0.2, bez promjene Qt Creator baze i bez "
"promjena koje narušavaju kompatibilnost za korisničke projekte."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Na ovoj stranici"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Najvažnije"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Force enter OpenMV Cam bootloader** is now available from the ``Tools`` "
"menu, forcing the connected cam into its bootloader on disconnect."
msgstr ""
"**Prisilni ulazak u OpenMV Cam bootloader** sada je dostupan iz izbornika "
"``Tools`` i prisiljava povezanu kameru na ulazak u bootloader pri "
"odspajanju."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Force bootloader** checkbox added to the ``Install the Latest Development "
"Release`` dialog to force bootloader entry when installing development "
"firmware, with a per-board safe default."
msgstr ""
"Potvrdni okvir **Force bootloader** dodan je u dijalog ``Install the Latest "
"Development Release`` radi prisilnog ulaska u bootloader prilikom "
"instalacije razvojnog ugrađenog programa (firmware), uz sigurnu zadanu "
"postavku po pločici."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:25
msgid ""
"**DFU-only devices no longer spuriously auto-connect**, since auto-reconnect"
" and board-settings auto-connect now trigger only for normally running "
"boards."
msgstr ""
"**Uređaji koji rade samo u DFU načinu više se ne povezuju automatski bez "
"razloga**\\ , budući da se automatsko ponovno povezivanje i automatsko "
"povezivanje prema postavkama pločice sada aktiviraju samo za pločice koje "
"rade normalno."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:27
msgid ""
"**PAG7936 example scripts on the AE3** are auto-rewritten to upscale the "
"``QQVGA`` framesize to ``QVGA`` on load."
msgstr ""
"**PAG7936 primjeri skripti na AE3** automatski se prepisuju kako bi se pri "
"učitavanju veličina sličice ``QQVGA`` povećala na ``QVGA``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Installer license handling fixed** so installation proceeds correctly from"
" the Ready-for-Installation page."
msgstr ""
"**Ispravljeno rukovanje licencom u instalacijskom programu** tako da "
"instalacija ispravno teče sa stranice Ready-for-Installation."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:33
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nove značajke"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Force enter OpenMV Cam bootloader.** A new item in the ``Tools`` menu "
"forces the connected cam into its bootloader on disconnect. The ``Install "
"the Latest Development Release`` dialog (reached from the ``Tools`` menu) "
"also gains a **Force bootloader** checkbox to force bootloader entry when "
"installing development firmware. (`350beb306 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/350beb306>`__, `13ca76904 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/13ca76904>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Prisilni ulazak u OpenMV Cam bootloader.** Nova stavka u izborniku "
"``Tools`` prisiljava povezanu kameru na ulazak u bootloader pri odspajanju. "
"Dijalog ``Install the Latest Development Release`` (dostupan iz izbornika "
"``Tools``\\ ) također dobiva potvrdni okvir **Force bootloader** za prisilni"
" ulazak u bootloader prilikom instalacije razvojnog ugrađenog programa "
"(firmware). (\\ `350beb306 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/350beb306>`__\\ , `13ca76904 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/13ca76904>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:44
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Ostale promjene i poboljšanja"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:46
msgid ""
"**Per-board force-bootloader default.** The development-release install "
"force-bootloader default is now driven per board via a new "
"``forceBootloaderDefaultSafe`` setting, defaulting on for the AE3 and N6 "
"(96E3/9206) boards and off for older DFU boards to avoid them not auto-"
"exiting the bootloader. (`13ca76904 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/13ca76904>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Zadana postavka prisilnog bootloadera po pločici.** Zadana postavka "
"prisilnog bootloadera pri instalaciji razvojnog izdanja sada se određuje po "
"pločici putem nove postavke ``forceBootloaderDefaultSafe``\\ , uključena "
"prema zadanome za AE3 i N6 (96E3/9206) pločice te isključena za starije DFU "
"pločice kako se ne bi dogodilo da automatski ne izađu iz bootloadera. (\\ "
"`13ca76904 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/13ca76904>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:52
msgid ""
"**PAG7936 framesize upscaling on the AE3.** On the AE3 with the PAG7936 "
"sensor, example scripts are auto-rewritten to upscale the ``QQVGA`` "
"framesize to ``QVGA`` when loaded. (`eed6325f5 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/eed6325f5>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Povećanje veličine sličice za PAG7936 na AE3.** Na AE3 sa senzorom PAG7936"
" primjeri skripti automatski se prepisuju kako bi se pri učitavanju veličina"
" sličice ``QQVGA`` povećala na ``QVGA``\\ . (\\ `eed6325f5 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/eed6325f5>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:56
msgid ""
"**Non-DFU-only auto-connect.** Auto-reconnect and board-settings auto-"
"connect now trigger only for non-DFU (normally running) boards rather than "
"any present board, so DFU-only devices no longer spuriously auto-connect. "
"(`350beb306 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/350beb306>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Automatsko povezivanje samo za pločice koje nisu samo DFU.** Automatsko "
"ponovno povezivanje i automatsko povezivanje prema postavkama pločice sada "
"se aktiviraju samo za pločice koje nisu samo DFU (one koje rade normalno), "
"umjesto za bilo koju prisutnu pločicu, pa se uređaji koji rade samo u DFU "
"načinu više ne povezuju automatski bez razloga. (\\ `350beb306 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/350beb306>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:63
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Ispravci grešaka"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:65
msgid ""
"Fixed a typo in the connect-time firmware-update prompt (\"lastest\" -> "
"\"latest release firmware\"). (`13ca76904 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/13ca76904>`__)"
msgstr ""
"Ispravljena je tipfeler u upitu za ažuriranje ugrađenog programa (firmware) "
"pri povezivanju (\"lastest\" -> \"latest release firmware\"). (\\ `13ca76904"
" <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/13ca76904>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:68
msgid ""
"Fixed the installer's license-acceptance handling so the install step runs "
"on the Ready-for-Installation page instead of the license-check page, and "
"removed the buggy bundled license file. (`a9d3fb904 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a9d3fb904>`__, `716827f07 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/716827f07>`__)"
msgstr ""
"Ispravljeno je rukovanje prihvaćanjem licence u instalacijskom programu tako"
" da se korak instalacije izvodi na stranici Ready-for-Installation umjesto "
"na stranici provjere licence te je uklonjena neispravna priložena licencna "
"datoteka. (\\ `a9d3fb904 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a9d3fb904>`__\\ , `716827f07 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/716827f07>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:75
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "Podrška za platforme i alate"

